    categories: ["geopolitica"],
    title: "Iranian army says it destroyed US drone over Persian Gulf",
    summary: "Iranian army says it destroyed US drone over Persian Gulf The Iranian army said it shot down a US Lucas drone over the Persian Gulf on Monday, according to Iran's semi-official Tasnim news agency. \"Earlier today, an American aggressor Lucas drone was struck and destroyed by the Army's indigenous air defence systems under the control of the country's integrated air defence network, over the waters of the Persian Gulf, east of the Strait of Hormuz,\" the army's public relations office said in a statement reported by Tasnim.",
    preview: "Iranian army says it destroyed US drone over Persian Gulf The Iranian army said it shot down a US Lucas drone over the Persian Gulf on Monday, according to Iran's semi-official Tasnim news agency. \"Earlier today, an American aggressor Lucas drone was struck and destroyed by the Army's indigenous air defence systems under the control of the country's integrated air defence network, over the waters of the Persian Gulf, east of the Strait of Hormuz,\" the army's public relations office said in a statement reported by Tasnim.",
    body: "Iranian army says it destroyed US drone over Persian Gulf The Iranian army said it shot down a US Lucas drone over the Persian Gulf on Monday, according to Iran's semi-official Tasnim news agency. \"Earlier today, an American aggressor Lucas drone was struck and destroyed by the Army's indigenous air defence systems under the control of the country's integrated air defence network, over the waters of the Persian Gulf, east of the Strait of Hormuz,\" the army's public relations office said in a statement reported by Tasnim.",
