    summary: "Houthi-run government says Saudi air strikes killed civilians in Lahj The Houthi government in Yemen said Saudi air strikes targeting buses in the governorate of Lahj had killed or wounded tens of civilians, rejecting earlier accusations by the Saudi-backed Yemeni government that the Houthis were responsible. The statement described the Saudi strikes as a \"horrific massacre\" that amounts to a war crime. Earlier reports of coalition air strikes on the area were published and later deleted by media outlets affiliated with Saudi Arabia.",
